{
  "dom_id": "step-e18710",
  "name": "Example: Computing Gradients of Functions Containing L1 Norms",
  "problem": "Given the function \n\n$$\nf(\\mathbf{x}, \\mathbf{w}) = -3\\left(\\|\\mathbf{w}\\|_1\\right)^3  - 5\\mathbf x^T\\mathbf w\n$$\n\nthat maps a vector to a scalar, find $\\nabla_{\\mathbf w}f.$ You may assume that $\\mathbf w$ has no zero components.",
  "worked_solution": "Using the results\n\n$$\n\\nabla_{\\mathbf w} (\\|\\mathbf{w}\\|_1) = \\text{sign}(\\mathbf{w}), \\qquad \\nabla_{\\mathbf w}\\left(\\mathbf x^T\\mathbf w\\right) = \\mathbf x,\n$$\n\n we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∇}_{w}f & ={∇}_{w}(-3{(‖w{‖}_{1})}^{3}-5{x}^{T}w) \\\\  & ={∇}_{w}(-3{(‖w{‖}_{1})}^{3})-{∇}_{w}(5{x}^{T}w) \\\\  & =-3\\cdot {∇}_{w}({(‖w{‖}_{1})}^{3})-5\\cdot {∇}_{w}({x}^{T}w) \\\\  & =-3\\cdot 3(‖w{‖}_{1})^{2}\\cdot {∇}_{w}(‖w{‖}_{1})-5\\cdot x \\\\  & =-3\\cdot 3(‖w{‖}_{1})^{2}\\cdot \\text{sign}(w)-5\\cdot x \\\\  & =-9(‖w{‖}_{1})^{2}\\cdot \\text{sign}(w)-5x.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-e18710\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block;\">\n    \n                 \n                <div class=\"example\">\n                    <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                        <div class=\"stepName\"><span class=\"stepType\">Example:</span> Computing Gradients of Functions Containing L1 Norms</div>       \n                        <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"e18710\">?</div>\n                    </div>\n            \n                    <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                        <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage * {\n          